{"id":"vod_lz_1306","vodId":"1306","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"七大罪","name_cn":"七大罪","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全集","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220325-1/3ea7eebbbe9c6012125f393f7bb54b29.png"},"summary":"七大罪又译《七原罪》，七大罪全集动画改编自日本漫画家铃木央所著漫画《七原罪》。　　七大罪动画全集讲述的是在虚构的大陆『布里塔利亚』上的国家『里昂妮丝王国』，王国的圣骑士们为了准备传说中的圣战而进行军备强化，然而圣骑士团的诸多暴行使得整个国家民不聊生，甚至发动政变囚禁了国王。　　担忧着国家现状的第三王女『伊丽莎白』，将救国的希望寄托于十年前因涉嫌颠覆王国而被通缉的骑士团『七大罪』从而独自踏上寻找的旅程。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-03-25 18:04:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/551_7bff7cd3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/547_1bf90852/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/548_f2207af2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/549_d1d479d6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/550_f497ca94/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/552_25308a5e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/562_45739346/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/553_cd12d654/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/554_bbb5359e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/555_5ee92ea4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/556_a859e633/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/557_674786cb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/558_616acac8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/559_25b54ac8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220325/560_232a3fd0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/2